# Quota planning

Before starting any medium or large task, call `check_budget`. If you are
planning multi-step work, call `plan_session` first and follow its ordering.
After finishing a task, call `record_task_cost` with the quota delta — `pct_used`
on a Pro/Max subscription, `usd_used` on API-key/Bedrock/Vertex auth.

The estimates start as seeds and only become real after two `record_task_cost`
calls per category+model+unit, so recording is what makes the tool worth having.
Read the burn-rate warning rather than the table when the two disagree.

On pay-per-token auth there is no rate-limit window: set a ceiling once with
`set_budget(daily_usd=…, monthly_usd=…)` and everything else works the same, in
dollars instead of percent.
